{"kind": "model", "latency": 55.9, "n_calls": 3, "text": "The corpus makes repetition unavoidable for specialized data at the target scale: code can supply only 8%, papers 4%, and math 0.8% without repeats. I\u2019m using several lower-cost proxy runs across the simplex to estimate both domain value and the penalty from repeated samples before spending the remaining budget on local refinement.", "calls": ["{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":1.0,\\\"code\\\":0.0,\\\"math\\\":0.0,\\\"papers\\\":0.0}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.7,\\\"code\\\":0.1,\\\"math\\\":0.1,\\\"papers\\\":0.1}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.5,\\\"code\\\":0.2,\\\"math\\\":0.2,\\\"papers\\\":0.1}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.5,\\\"code\\\":0.1,\\\"math\\\":0.1,\\\"papers\\\":0.3}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.8,\\\"code\\\":0.08,\\\"math\\\":0.02,\\\"papers\\\":0.1}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.8,\\\"code\\\":0.1,\\\"math\\\":0.01,\\\"papers\\\":0.09}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.85,\\\"code\\\":0.05,\\\"math\\\":0.05,\\\"papers\\\":0.05}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=5e7 D=1e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.6,\\\"code\\\":0.2