{"kind": "model", "latency": 62.3, "n_calls": 5, "text": "The first sweep confirms the composite is driven by specialist data, especially math and code, but the best proxy point already has enough math to approach its finite pool. I\u2019m now probing target-like repetition levels with larger proxies and mixtures shifted toward the likely constrained optimum; this is the key tradeoff because target-scale math and papers would otherwise be reused many times.", "calls": ["{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=1e8 D=2e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.78,\\\"code\\\":0.12,\\\"math\\\":0.02,\\\"papers\\\":0.08}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}", "{\"command\":[\"bash\",\"-lc\",\"/app/bin/lab train N=1e8 D=2e10 --json '{\\\"mix\\\":{\\\"web\\\":0.68,\\\"code\\\":0.15,\\\"math\\\":0.03,\\\"papers\\\":0.14}}'\"],\"timeout_ms\":150000,\"workdir\":\"/app\"}"], "usage": 1165, "effort": "high", "t": 1790526546.5083468}
